{
  "_doc": "Task 882 — DOES THIS PREAMBLE LOAD PACKAGE X? One corpus, two readers: the app's `preambleListLoadsPackage` (src/lib/latex-lexer.ts, read by src/lib/__tests__/package-load-reader.test.ts) and its port `preamble_list_loads_package` in editor/scripts/bib_family.py (read by editor/scripts/tests/test_package_load_parity.py). Input is an ALREADY-projected live preamble. `expect` is the boolean answer for `package`.",
